### 账户激活功能 API 测试

### 1. 发送激活验证码
POST http://localhost:8082/user/activation/send-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificationId": "110101199001010011",
  "userName": "测试用户",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 2. 验证激活码（请替换为实际收到的验证码）
POST http://localhost:8082/user/activation/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificationId": "110101199001010011",
  "verificationCode": "123456"
}

### 3. 查询激活状态
GET http://localhost:8082/user/activation/status?identificationId=110101199001010011

### 测试场景

### 场景1：正常激活流程
# 1. 先注册用户（如果还没有）
POST http://localhost:8082/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userAccount": "testuser@example.com",
  "userPassword": "password123",
  "userName": "测试用户",
  "userGender": "男",
  "userEmail": "test@example.com",
  "userPhone": "13800138000",
  "birthday": "1990-01-01",
  "identificationId": "110101199001010011"
}

# 2. 发送验证码
POST http://localhost:8082/user/activation/send-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificationId": "110101199001010011",
  "userName": "测试用户",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

# 3. 验证并激活
POST http://localhost:8082/user/activation/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificationId": "110101199001010011",
  "verificationCode": "从邮箱中获取的验证码"
}

### 场景2：验证码错误
POST http://localhost:8082/user/activation/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificationId": "110101199001010011",
  "verificationCode": "000000"
}

### 场景3：重复激活
# 对已激活的账户再次发送验证码
POST http://localhost:8082/user/activation/send-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificationId": "110101199001010011",
  "userName": "测试用户",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 场景4：身份证号不存在
POST http://localhost:8082/user/activation/send-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificationId": "999999999999999999",
  "userName": "不存在的用户",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 场景5：邮箱格式错误
POST http://localhost:8082/user/activation/send-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificationId": "110101199001010011",
  "userName": "测试用户",
  "email": "invalid-email"
}

### 场景6：验证码格式错误
POST http://localhost:8082/user/activation/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificationId": "110101199001010011",
  "verificationCode": "12345"
}
